Converts a coordinate in the world copy nearest the camera's center, even
while the center is past ±180°, in Map::pixelForLatLng, MapProjection, the
location indicator, and its hit testing. This carries the upstream pull
request in place of our own fix, which covered only MapProjection, so Map and
MapProjection disagreed. Temporary: drop this patch when the submodule moves
to a core that includes the pull request.
Upstream: https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-native/pull/4776 at 1b35aa17

